{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.exists_axiom_4_volume","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L30-L49","doc":"**Lemma statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $V \\in \\mathbf{C}$ be the standard representation of dimension\n$n$.  The quantum determinant $\\epsilon \\colon \\Lambda^{n} V \\to \\mathbf{1}$\nis invariant under all tensor automorphisms of the fibre functor:*\n\n$$\n  \\epsilon \\circ \\Lambda^{n}(g_{V}) = \\epsilon\n  \\quad \\text{for all } g \\in \\mathrm{Aut}^{\\otimes}(\\tau).\n$$\n\n*This verifies axiom~(4) of\n[quantum observable universe](#def:quantum-observable-universe).\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:qou-exists-axiom-4","label":"lem:qou-exists-axiom-4","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/qou-exists-axiom-4.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.det_eq_const","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.det_eq_const","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L28-L28","doc":"The determinant function evaluates to this constant. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.const_val","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.const_val","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L26-L26","doc":"The constant determinant value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.ε","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.ε","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L24-L24","doc":"The quantum determinant `ε : Λ^n V → 𝟙`, encoded as a scalar\nvalue `ε : G → ℝ` post-functor evaluation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.G","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L21-L21","doc":"The Tannaka group `G = Aut⊗(τ)` (abstract group type). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.CategoricalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.CategoricalObj","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L19-L19","doc":"The categorical object / monoidal structure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.ExistsAxiom4VolumeContext","kind":"class","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuantumObservableUniverse/exists_axiom_4_volume.lean#L15-L28","doc":"Abstract context for the `exists_axiom_4_volume` claim — manuscript-themed\ntyped fields below; `holds` carries the residual `Prop` claim. ","signatureChunk":0}]}